{"publicId":"afe96f84-56ae-4d9e-ba25-1e6c3012ef5c","title":"挪威大学团队提出海底火山活动与地幔LLSVPs结构存在关联","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T20:00:12.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-12T20:00:12.000Z","digest":"挪威大学奥斯陆分校团队在《自然·地球科学》发表论文，称海底火山活动与深部地幔的两个LLSVPs（低密度层状超地幔结构）存在关联。研究通过地震波数据分析发现，LLSVPs结构可能通过热传导或物质对流影响海底火山喷发频率和规模。此前学界普遍认为地幔顶部结构对火山活动起主要作用，该成果为理解地球内部动力机制提供了新视角，但具体作用机制仍需进一步验证。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-12T20:17:49.104Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"挪威大学奥斯陆分校团队在 Nature Geoscience 发表海底火山活动与深部地幔结构关联研究","latestReport":{"id":"twrt5fp34o8vphngcemmu7hdo"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fY15DARVK5xA","title":"发现地球深部结构可能促进海底火山活动","firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T20:00:12.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"twrt5fp34o8vphngcemmu7hdo","title":"挪威大学奥斯陆分校团队在 Nature Geoscience 发表海底火山活动与深部地幔结构关联研究","summary":"Conrad 和 Domeier 在 Nature Geoscience 发表论文，揭示海底火山活动与深部地幔的两个 LLSVPs 结构（DOI:10.1038/s41561-026-02007-z）存在关联。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T20:00:12.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"twrt5fp34o8vphngcemmu7hdo","title":"挪威大学奥斯陆分校团队在 Nature Geoscience 发表海底火山活动与深部地幔结构关联研究","summary":"Conrad 和 Domeier 在 Nature Geoscience 发表论文，揭示海底火山活动与深部地幔的两个 LLSVPs 结构（DOI:10.1038/s41561-026-02007-z）存在关联。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T20:00:12.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","heat":5.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":5.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11